{"title": "Assam Minister's Daughter Joins NEET Protest, CM Reacts", "summary": "The daughter of an Assam minister joined a protest against the NEET exam on Tuesday. She was seen participating in demonstrations and raising slogans against the government. Chief Minister Himanta Biswa Sarma commented on the situation, stating that his daughter might not follow in his footsteps. The protest concerns alleged irregularities in the NEET exam.", "summary_points": ["An Assam minister's daughter joined protests against the NEET exam.", "She participated in demonstrations and raised slogans against the government.", "Chief Minister Himanta Biswa Sarma commented on his daughter's participation.", "The protests are related to alleged irregularities in the NEET exam."], "title_hi": "NEET विरोध: असम के मंत्री की बेटी ने की शिरकत, सीएम ने दी प्रतिक्रिया", "summary_hi": "असम के एक मंत्री की बेटी ने मंगलवार को NEET परीक्षा के खिलाफ विरोध प्रदर्शन में भाग लिया। उन्हें प्रदर्शनकारियों में शामिल होते और सरकार के खिलाफ नारे लगाते देखा गया। मुख्यमंत्री हिमंत बिस्वा सरमा ने इस स्थिति पर टिप्पणी करते हुए कहा कि उनकी बेटी शायद उनके नक्शेकदम पर न चले। यह विरोध NEET परीक्षा में कथित अनियमितताओं से संबंधित है।", "summary_points_hi": ["असम के एक मंत्री की बेटी ने NEET परीक्षा के खिलाफ विरोध प्रदर्शन में भाग लिया।", "उन्होंने प्रदर्शनों में हिस्सा लिया और सरकार के खिलाफ नारे लगाए।", "मुख्यमंत्री हिमंत बिस्वा सरमा ने अपनी बेटी की भागीदारी पर टिप्पणी की।", "ये विरोध NEET परीक्षा में कथित अनियमितताओं से संबंधित हैं।"], "framing": {"center": "Centrist coverage highlighted the participation of the Assam minister's daughter in the NEET protest, noting she raised slogans against the government. The reports also included Chief Minister Himanta Biswa Sarma's reaction to his daughter joining the demonstrations."}, "framing_hi": {"center": "केंद्रवादी कवरेज ने NEET विरोध प्रदर्शन में असम के मंत्री की बेटी की भागीदारी पर प्रकाश डाला, जिसमें बताया गया कि उन्होंने सरकार के खिलाफ नारे लगाए। रिपोर्टों में मुख्यमंत्री हिमंत बिस्वा सरमा की अपनी बेटी के प्रदर्शनों में शामिल होने पर प्रतिक्रिया भी शामिल थी।"}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://www.hindustantimes.com/ht-img/img/2026/07/26/550x309/pradhan_himanta_1785041405917_1785041412091_a47edbb3-1889-448c-a0b4-963b0bce824a.png", "sources": [{"source": "Amar Ujala", "owner": "Amar Ujala", "lean": "center", "language": "hi", "url": "https://www.amarujala.com/india-news/assam-ministers-daughter-joins-neet-protest-raises-slogans-against-government-what-cm-himanta-says-2026-07-26", "headline": "NEET Protest: असम के मंत्री की बेटी भी प्रदर्शन में उतरी, सरकार के खिलाफ लगाए नारे; CM सरमा ने क्या कहा?"}, {"source": "Hindustan Times", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.hindustantimes.com/india-news/she-may-not-follow-her-father-assam-ministers-daughter-joins-neet-protest-cm-himanta-sarma-reacts-101785040270056.html", "headline": "She may not follow her father …: Assam minister daughter joins NEET protest ; CM Himanta reacts"}, {"source": "Mint", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/india/not-satisfied-with-resignation-deceased-neet-aspirants-mother-reacts-demands-ouster-of-pm-modi-amit-shah-11785053920624.html", "headline": "‘Not satisfied with resignation’: Deceased NEET aspirant's mother reacts, demands ouster of PM Modi, Amit Shah"}, {"source": "Mint", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/trends/shweta-tiwari-asks-cjp-to-protest-in-punjab-gets-heavily-trolled-online-start-hunger-strike-were-with-you-11785055336435.html", "headline": "Shweta Tiwari asks CJP to protest in Punjab, gets heavily trolled online, ‘Start hunger strike; we're with you’"}, {"source": "Aaj Tak", "owner": "India Today Group", "lean": "right", "language": "hi", "url": "https://www.aajtak.in/madhya-pradesh/story/doctor-dream-left-unfinished-father-hides-daughter-photos-neet-aspi